WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Two worlds, one app
Choose Storybook or Editorial. Plan tasks and keep your memories.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Plan your day
View today’s tasks, mark them complete and follow your progress.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Add tasks your way
Type or speak. Review the title, date and time before saving.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Organize for later
Keep future tasks in order. Due tasks appear in Today.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Your days become a story
Pro: look back at daily records and completed tasks.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A closer look at your day
Pro: add personal notes and photos to your day.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Editorial world
The same planning tools in a calm, clean theme.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Choose your world
Pick your theme. Change it later in Settings.
